</section>
<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Method Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This table summarizes the method-specific hyperparameters used for each continual learning algorithm in our experiments. Sequential Fine-Tuning, Dynamic Weight Expansion, and multitask training are omitted, as they do not introduce any additional hyperparameters beyond those shared across all experiments.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A7.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Algorithm-specific hyperparameters.</span></figcaption>
