<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>Environment Description</h2>

<div id="A8.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we describe the environments used in our experiments, including task visualizations, natural language instructions, and the corresponding train-test splits.</p>
</div>
