<section id="A8.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">H.2.1 </span>Training Tasks</h4>

<div id="A8.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="A8.I3" class="ltx_enumerate ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A8.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A8.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:59.6pt;"><img src="2603.11653v1/images/libero_long/put_the_black_bowl_in_the_bottom_drawer_of_the_cabinet_and_close_it.png" id="A8.I3.i1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:83/83;" width="83" height="83" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</div>
<div id="A8.I3.i1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:318.0pt;">
<p id="A8.I3.i1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">put the black bowl in the bottom drawer of the cabinet and close it</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A8.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A8.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:59.6pt;"><img src="2603.11653v1/images/libero_long/put_the_white_mug_on_the_left_plate_and_put_the_yellow_and_white_mug_on_the_right_plate.png" id="A8.I3.i2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:83/83;" width="83" height="83" alt="[Uncaptioned image]">
</div>
<div id="A8.I3.i2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:318.0pt;">
<p id="A8.I3.i2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">put the white mug on the left plate and put the yellow and white mug on the right plate</p>
